# Neon for Dimetra

Follow Neon agent skills in `.agents/skills/` (see `skills-lock.json`).

## When to read which skill

| Task | Skill |
|------|--------|
| Overview, link, env pull, branches | `neon` |
| SQL, schema, `DATABASE_URL`, pooled vs direct | `neon-postgres` |
| Auth / users | `neon-auth` |

Prefer the **Neon CLI** over MCP when it is installed and authenticated.

## This repo

- **Connection:** `DATABASE_URL` (Neon **pooled** string). Loaded from `.env`, then `.env.local` (`src/loadEnv.ts`).
- **Schema:** `src/db/schema.ts` and `src/db/migrations/` — applied on every backend start via `initDb()` in `src/db/initDb.ts`.
- **Driver:** `pg` pool in `src/db/pool.ts` — not SQLite.
- **Do not** commit `.env.local`, `.neon`, or API keys.

## Common commands

```bash
neon env pull          # refresh DATABASE_URL for linked branch (.neon)
npm run db:init        # test connection + create tables
npm run build && npm start
```

Official agent setup: https://neon.com/prompts/agent-setup.md
